## Install
```bash
git clone https://github.com/GooLey1025/paddy.git
cd paddy
echo "export PATH=\$PATH:$(pwd)/src/paddy/scripts" >> ~/.bashrc
source ~/.bashrc
conda create -n paddy python=3.10
conda activate paddy
pip install -e .
